[h3]Storage Tiles Check the Thermometer[/h3]
[list]
[*] Added delivery temperature limit support to Storage Tiles, including those aboard rockets.
[*] Duplicants will now reject materials outside a configured Storage Tile’s temperature range instead of declaring hot cargo “properly stowed.”
[/list]

Thanks to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/id/shylion]ShyLion[/url] for suggesting the fix. The “under the floor” thermal exemption has been revoked.
